I've updated the agenda with all of the above. Our first priority should still be to get a clear path to resolve all Pectra issues and get the fork activated on mainnet. IMO we should spend as much time as necessary on the call discussing this. 

@fjl we can at least flag your RPC PR but if we're out of time and need more discussion, maybe we can discuss it on next Monday's RPC call? 

@Amxx @wjmelements @kevaundray I can't guarantee we'll have time to cover your topics. If you don't want to sit through the call to _maybe_ discuss it at the end, we can already plan the conversation for 2 weeks from now, when most urgent Pectra topics should will hopefully be resolved.
